      "writtenOn": "2022-03-21T16:10:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At the level I would be calling this, I don\u0027t have access to the particular Device being used for the image upload. So this just punts and flushes all the Devices attached to the Recorder.",
      "parentUuid": "effdeaa3_558762a7",
